  "findings": [
    {
      "topic": "Two explicit radial values",
      "finding": "Both900/901 e slots must be serialized in fixed order even if absent, zero, geometrically inactive, unused by the current metal, or h/H-identical. No h/H-only model identity is sufficient."
    },
    {
      "topic": "e-only activation",
      "finding": "Pinned radial setup calls periodicradialsetup before its inactive return; nonzero either e sets lractive. GATE must retain active backend/certificate sequencing, never classify by h/H magnitude."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Raw unequal RHS",
      "finding": "Parent writer receives separate raw1/raw2 and emits six DIRECT components. V2 must preserve both without copying, averaging or adding h in the serialization. after_direct separately verifies shared h addition to each."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Serialization",
      "finding": "Fixed V2 header, explicit cell/cutoffs/both Ewald exponents/induction controls/both e records, exact field cardinalities/order, finite domains and four-count END are suitable additions to the unchanged site/spline/qfac body."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Cutoff authority",
      "finding": "Pinned cutoff12 GATE already checks12/9/8.1, .4/.4,64cubed/order5,poleps1e-8/politer100 and retains intrinsic maxval recovery. Old CERTIFY.assemble still hardcodes cutoff9 and must not be reused unchanged for a V2 runtime."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Central shortcut",
      "finding": "COMMON.source_context forces old center; initialization and NATIVE prohibit fresh central initialization; COMMON.certificate auto-links central to old Stage1/state/factor. Future V2 adapters must remove these shortcuts and require the same explicitly admitted chain for a fresh center as changed states."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Settings chain",
      "finding": "Input keys, native gate/readback, parser expected settings, real assembly cutoff/split, factor matrix/shift and certificate/root admission must share literal settings. Unchanged reciprocal qfac does not authorize reuse of a changed real matrix."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Legacy projection",
      "finding": "Only explicit zero-e comparison with independently pinned same scientific settings can project V2 tokens to V1. A9A state cannot become12A, and projected bytes are not an executable native expected state."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Native gates",
      "finding": "Source-only radial tree retains normal fatal backend/stability routines. Identity serialization does not grant an induced solve; active exact-state comparison remains after direct initialization and before first mutual/PCG operation."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Nominal scope",
      "finding": "Keep tau=1e-6*(UB+UR)+delta_odd, unknown e_app and ordinary-double scope. Identity work supplies no new stability, periodic-force or trajectory qualification."
    },
    {
      "topic": "Later build identity",
      "finding": "V2 serializer/gate reference new polar lrpshape symbols. Future old-baseline linkage must preserve its own module/archive lineage; linking new observation objects against a pre-radial archive cannot be assumed to work."
    }
  ],
